    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t02-mother-02-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s07-t02-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "静止起步、停下的两端加减速，平均速度均为最高速度的一半。"
        }
      ],
